{
  "name": "Argent Conjunction",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At the start of your turn, you can choose to gain the effects of all Lunar Phases at the same time (no action required). If you choose to activate the effect of a Lunar Phase, you likewise trigger the active effects of all Lunar Phases.</p><p>You can use this feature twice and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
